stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Composing : Target decision triggers context request
    Composing --> Validating : Context composition compiled
    Validating --> Active : Checks pass, published
    Active --> Stale : Validity age threshold exceeded
    Stale --> Expired : Evicted from live reasoning cache
    Expired --> Archived : Long-term trace logging completed
    Archived --> [*]
